<doc id="6426" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=6426" title="Daptar basa">
Daptar basa

Daptar basa diruntuykeun nurutkeun ngaran Sunda. Struktur runtuyan séjénna:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Daptar%20kulawarga%20basa"&gt;Daptar kulawarga basa&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="ISO%20639"&gt;ISO 639&lt;/a&gt;たら</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Daptar%20kode%20ISO%20639-3"&gt;Daptar kode ISO 639-3&lt;/a&gt;た</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Daptar%20basa%20dumasar%20sistim%20tulisan"&gt;Daptar basa dumasar sistim tulisan&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Daptar%20basa%20dumasar%20jumlah%20pamak%C3%A9"&gt;Daptar basa dumasar jumlah pamaké&lt;/a&gt;</li>
